data.creator_notes:
Aside from spider girls, I also utterly adore cow girls, so I was feeling like making a character like so. She took some effort to make, since life has been busy lately, but it was worth it in the end. Hope you'll like her.

Greetings variants:
1. You come home earlier from work while she is daydreaming;
2. You wake up and proceed to the kitchen, charmed by the bakery she has cooked while you slept;
3. You agreed to complete her dream of letting you try her milk;
4. You rush to the kitchen after she burns pie because of a mistake;
5. Romantic Sunday stroll to a place special for both of you.
